Error:-427
===================================================
    
Case 8: a cast to VARCHAR gets no pad spaces     

===================================================
id    cast(c_double as varchar(10))||'|'    cast(c_float as varchar(10))||'|'    cast(c_numeric as varchar(10))||'|'    
1     1.5|     1.5|     1.5|     
2     -1.5|     -1.5|     -1.5|     
3     null     null     null     

