===================================================
    
Case 10: a cast to CHAR with the euckr charset pads with its two-byte space     

===================================================
id    char_length( cast(c_double as char(10) collate euckr_bin))    octet_length( cast(c_double as char(10) collate euckr_bin))    char_length( cast(c_double as char(10) collate euckr_bin)||'|')    octet_length( cast(c_double as char(10) collate euckr_bin)||'|')    
1     10     17     11     18     
2     10     16     11     17     
3     null     null     null     null     

===================================================
id    char_length( cast(c_numeric as char(10) collate euckr_bin))    octet_length( cast(c_numeric as char(10) collate euckr_bin))    char_length( cast(c_numeric as char(10) collate euckr_bin)||'|')    octet_length( cast(c_numeric as char(10) collate euckr_bin)||'|')    
1     10     17     11     18     
2     10     16     11     17     
3     null     null     null     null     

