Case 11: the || operator on a cast to CHAR(100) returns 101 characters, with no crash     

===================================================
id    char_length( cast(c_double as char(100))||'|')    char_length( cast(c_float as char(100))||'|')    char_length( cast(c_numeric as char(100))||'|')    
1     101     101     101     
2     101     101     101     
3     null     null     null     

